From 79ac32ea4a6e500e2a9d5fe819a211f03e1b24fd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 01/12] FreeChat: disappearing messages

- Room setting (Security & Privacy) to pick a TTL via the
  com.freechat.disappearing state event
- Timeline notice when the TTL changes
- Hide messages the server expired (com.freechat.expired) without a
  'message deleted' placeholder
- List attachment MXCs in plaintext (com.freechat.media) on encrypted
  events so the server can delete the files on expiry

New code lives in apps/web/src/freechat/; upstream files only get
small hooks.
